<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-26T15:20:35.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:20:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF has intensified drone strikes, cutting power across southeast Sudan and targeting markets and hospitals, killing civilians and limiting medical care. The UK has imposed sanctions on Sudanese military leaders linked to a campaign of rape in El Fasher. The UAE’s involvement is criticised as contributing bloodshed, while refugees who fled Darfur now see their children growing up in the same camp. Gold miners face dangerous, laborious conditions, and humanitarian aid remains limited. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQTzFZTjVTeEZ2NGxlLTA5OTZNQWtudFh1MmJwR3FvR1hXY0hDQU10a0hldmxXenBaUGlZOUNxTTdZdllEeC1YNlgxVWdGcV9Ddy1GT19TOWF0eGt3WlgwMWZoYi1YaGZLSV8xZEVOZHFIdTFPUzRDTTFQWmFaQzk3dGl1OWVUYlloek1wVkdQUDZQdFYwM2t4VEZsWngyY0ZoX2MtTjFBUS1iWWkzTTVtTEQ1ZV9kcG5CbmhBYmszS3pRQ1pQYTVZdTZfdjJLUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNSzBEZmtHYmdYQ3pNUm95WERPRmYtbklKR08wdEJjVTdGRFpWQXY3aF96Y0l2QUpSa3VYbjItSzFfWlFtZzRNN3lmME43c0VjYzlPR2RuQnY4SEMyR2FCWFRBcWM3alB6anpFM0pkOGQwenh1NnBFZVd5X1hxOGM5b1JqbU5TSldKRDUxWnpsTGhsZF91eUdFN19uc1FfQUVfbko0NEdmbHM0Vmd6XzJBTkN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPTlFzbUZKbklnLUFORjB5NHJZQWJpLTYtS2tEWkU2T1JQNkZoNmJlX3NyazNPOGNvUzJvRTVENTFQeFgwN2hrOGZSWGRtOXpQUWpOT3g2d0YxU192WnpRQVBfSXg4aENHVjFOQmNLUXVZYUZTSXRURU1PUmkyb2dualpRMDUxRFlHSEdoM2VacXZORXo0d3FIeEduYmhCYTBwcU9EWE9HdWVDYzZqZThTVm1GUDdnS2xFSlpHWVhld0pWUms?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http